# Gate starts, 10, set from a counted run (BL-878): the e2e cell r-old (1), the 5 starts its real SAFE-STOP walk makes
# of the gate (the --safe-stop start and 4 nested classify runs, covered by the nested row of cells.decl), and the 4 cli
# cells. Every other gate run is one in-process call of sug_main, each paired with an fx_inproc: the source (1), r_current and
# r_noanchor (2), the 7 rc pairs, the enclosed-layout run (1) and the 4 equivalence twins (4) make the 15 of the inproc row.
# RE-MEASURE when an arm or a gate run is added or removed, AND when range.sh's range moves: a newer
# anchor-adding commit changes the walk's candidate count, so its nested-run count can move with history.
65 *
10 core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/self-update-gate.sh
15 inproc:core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/self-update-gate.sh
